  "bio": "Madison Crawley is an exceptionally skilled tattoo artist based in Buford, United States, specializing in stunning black and gray, as well as intricate floral designs. Their breathtaking work can be viewed on their dedicated portfolio page @madisoncrawleytattoos on Instagram. Madison's reputation for professionalism is evident, ensuring every client's experience is as flawless as their tattoos. If you're looking to add a piece of art to your skin, click the link below to book an appointment at the reputed @inkedarts shop.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Buford, Georgia, United States"
